    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/2c8fdf2fe7a274081d026e8cc2fdf543.poster.avif?t=1688870805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/2c8fdf2fe7a274081d026e8cc2fdf543.webm?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/2c8fdf2fe7a274081d026e8cc2fdf543.mp4?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Embark on a thrilling quest for legendary treasures hidden in the depths 'Below the Ocean'!<br><br>Discover an enchanting underwater realm in this captivating 2D side-scrolling platformer. Master your oxygen supply's tether to elegantly swing through unique levels, solving intriguing puzzles that challenge and delight.<br><br>Key features include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four action-packed chapters, each filled with unique mechanics, hand-crafted puzzles, and legendary treasures waiting to be discovered!<br></li><li>Collect shiny diamonds as an optional challenge for those who dare to push their limits!<br></li><li>Test your skills and race against time in a speedrun-friendly environment designed for true adventurers!<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a charming minimalistic 1-bit art style, beautifully enhanced with splashes of color.</li></ul><br>Unravel the ocean's deepest secrets as countless explorers before you have sought to do, diving deeper and deeper against all instincts of safety and self-preservation.<br><br>Are you ready to heed the call of the abyss, conquer its challenges, and claim your destiny as a fearless treasure hunter? Dive into the mesmerizing world of 'Below the Ocean' today!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/0c44c9400a6aaf0e13edd360781c6b38.poster.avif?t=1688870805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/0c44c9400a6aaf0e13edd360781c6b38.webm?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/0c44c9400a6aaf0e13edd360781c6b38.mp4?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/2c8fdf2fe7a274081d026e8cc2fdf543.poster.avif?t=1688870805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/2c8fdf2fe7a274081d026e8cc2fdf543.webm?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/2c8fdf2fe7a274081d026e8cc2fdf543.mp4?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Embark on a thrilling quest for legendary treasures hidden in the depths 'Below the Ocean'!<br><br>Discover an enchanting underwater realm in this captivating 2D side-scrolling platformer. Master your oxygen supply's tether to elegantly swing through unique levels, solving intriguing puzzles that challenge and delight.<br><br>Key features include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four action-packed chapters, each filled with unique mechanics, hand-crafted puzzles, and legendary treasures waiting to be discovered!<br></li><li>Collect shiny diamonds as an optional challenge for those who dare to push their limits!<br></li><li>Test your skills and race against time in a speedrun-friendly environment designed for true adventurers!<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a charming minimalistic 1-bit art style, beautifully enhanced with splashes of color.</li></ul><br>Unravel the ocean's deepest secrets as countless explorers before you have sought to do, diving deeper and deeper against all instincts of safety and self-preservation.<br><br>Are you ready to heed the call of the abyss, conquer its challenges, and claim your destiny as a fearless treasure hunter? Dive into the mesmerizing world of 'Below the Ocean' today!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/0c44c9400a6aaf0e13edd360781c6b38.poster.avif?t=1688870805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/0c44c9400a6aaf0e13edd360781c6b38.webm?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663270/extras/0c44c9400a6aaf0e13edd360781c6b38.mp4?t=1688870805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
